AUDIO: 'Now I\'ll go through generating video from an image plus audio. I generated the voice in advance from text and a voice sample in the Fish Audio S2 voice model. In this case the person in the image will speak the ready-made voice recording. The inpaint option allows or forbids changing the audio track — I\'ll turn it off, since I already have the recording.'

